    "description": "Took a step back to focus on some crucial growth areas, both professionally and personally!\n\nProfessional Growth:\n- Worked on passion projects and completed Buildspace's 6-week program, ending with a live presentation and meetup in SF.\n- Collaborated with peers from TechWeek LA to develop a journaling app that leverages generative AI to reflect on the user's past patterns and experiences and pave a clear path towards their goals.\n- Deepened my technical proficiency with courses such as Epic React and books like 'The Pragmatic Programmer.'\n- Broadened my product development acumen by reading books like 'The Lean Startup.' \n- Enhanced my understanding of personal and consumer psychology through books such as 'Wanting: The Power of Mimetic Desire in Everyday Life.'\n\nPersonal Milestones:\n- Got engaged and ahead on wedding planning!\n- Finished moving in and settling into our new home.\n- Got back into shape and achieved my best 5k run time.\n- Completed a 10-day silent meditation retreat and continue to maintain daily practice.\n- Welcomed our new miniature dachshund, Milo, to the family.",
